{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02881","headline":"孝敬皇帝挽歌 · 刘禕之","name":"孝敬皇帝挽歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"戒奢虚蜃辂，锡号纪鸿名。\n地叶苍梧野，途经紫聚城。\n重照掩寒色，晨飙断曙声。\n一随仙骥远，霜雪愁阴生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禕之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02881.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02881","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}